{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01MXFupdZwcdq4fm3aPagbAz","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Feature request: slugify\n2\t\n3\tAdd `slugify(title: string): string` to `src/text.ts` for building URL slugs.\n4\t\n5\tRules:\n6\t1. Lowercase the result.\n7\t2. Remove diacritics (e.g. \"Crème Brûlée\" → \"creme-brulee\").\n8\t3. Any run of characters that are not `a-z` or `0-9` becomes a single `-`.\n9\t4. No leading or trailing `-`.\n10\t5. An input with no letters or digits returns `\"\"`.\n11\t\n12\tExamples: `slugify(\"Hello, World!\")` → `\"hello-world\"`, `slugify(\"  Ship it -- now  \")` → `\"ship-it-now\"`.\n13\t\n14\tConstraints: no new dependencies; existing functions must keep their behavior.\n15\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"ee081de0-ce13-49ff-b643-468772ae81de","uuid":"1ecc7a2d-dd6a-4bd9-8d68-c1374aa8536e","timestamp":"2026-10-21T07:28:53.409Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/private/tmp/claude-501/m10-tmp/m10-omc-a-1-1792567731032/docs/feature-request.md","content":"# Feature request: slugify\n\nAdd `slugify(title: string): string` to `src/text.ts` for building URL slugs.\n\nRules:\n1. Lowercase the result.\n2. Remove diacritics (e.g. \"Crème Brûlée\" → \"creme-brulee\").\n3. Any run of characters that are not `a-z` or `0-9` becomes a single `-`.\n4. No leading or trailing `-`.\n5. An input with no letters or digits returns `\"\"`.\n\nExamples: `slugify(\"Hello, World!\")` → `\"hello-world\"`, `slugify(\"  Ship it -- now  \")` → `\"ship-it-now\"`.\n\nConstraints: no new dependencies; existing functions must keep their behavior.\n","numLines":15,"startLine":1,"totalLines":15}}}
